00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:52.400
F0 itself, when you
integrate, there

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:55.460
is equal amount of heat
going forward the backward.

00:11:55.460 --> 00:11:59.660
There's no left flux
in this material.

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:03.680
But things will be different
when I go to the interface

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:06.980
because the f0 in
this first media.

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:12.000
And the f0, 2 in the two
media could be different.

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:16.040
So now I do the left flux.

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:26.970
So again, start with my
summation of all the modes.

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:30.570
In this case, what's left
flux across the interface

00:12:30.570 --> 00:12:34.980
